{"hymn":"S352","parent":"E463","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Yo quiero tanto a mi Amo","subtitle":"Consagración—Servir al Señor","syl":{"n1":"Yo","n2":["quie","i"],"n3":["ro","t"],"n4":["tan","i"],"n5":["to‿a","t"],"n6":["mi‿A","i"],"n7":["mo","t"],"n8":"Que","n9":["li","i"],"n10":["bre","t"],"n11":"no","n12":["sal","i"],"n13":["dré;","t"],"n14":"Me","n15":["re","i"],"n16":["di","m"],"n17":["mió","t"],"n18":"con","n19":["pre","i"],"n20":["cio","t"],"n21":"Me‿ha","n22":["con","i"],"n23":["quis","m"],"n24":["ta","m"],"n25":["do","t"],"n26":"El.","n27":"No","n28":["de","i"],"n29":["ja","m"],"n30":["ré‿el","t"],"n31":["ser","i"],"n32":["vi","m"],"n33":["cio,","t"],"n34":"Es","n35":["dul","i"],"n36":["ce","t"],"n37":["ben","i"],"n38":["di","m"],"n39":["ción,","t"],"n40":"Y‿en","n41":"los","n42":["mo","i"],"n43":["men","m"],"n44":["tos","t"],"n45":["du","i"],"n46":["ros","t"],"n47":"Me","n48":"da","n49":["con","i"],"n50":["so","m"],"n51":["la","m"],"n52":["ción.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Mi Amo dio Su sangre","Por un vasallo‿infiel,","Cortó las ataduras","Del mal y el ego cruel.","Me trajo‿a Su servicio,","Me permitió‿elegir","La libertad perfecta","Que no dejaré ir."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["No acortaré‿el servicio,","¡Yo todo aquí daré!","A Él, que me‿ama tanto,","Que dio Su mismo ser.","Con gozo yo le adoro,","Por eso cantaré:","Yo quiero tanto a mi Amo","Que libre no saldré."]}]}